/S /P
/E (We began by implementing a basic UNet architecture using PyTorch, leveraging GPU resources \(NVIDIA Tesla P100\) on Kaggle. However, the training process was computationally intensive, with each epoch taking significant time due to the large satellite imagery dataset. To address this, we explored hardware acceleration options and transitioned to TensorFlow with Tensor Processing Units \(TPUs\). This shift resulted in a dramatic improvement, reducing training time by approximately 10x per epoch, enabling faster experimentation and iteration.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
