/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This section evaluates the performance of various models tested for the satellite cloud mask segmentation project. The trials encompass different UNet architectures, backbones, loss functions, and training strategies. All models were validated using the global Dice metric, which computes the Dice coefficient across the entire validation set, rather than the mean Dice coefficient per image. Detailed results, including Dice metric, custom Dice score, custom Jaccard index, and loss values, are presented below.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
