<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The final model, a custom UNet trained for 25 epochs with Binary Crossentropy, achieved a mean Dice coefficient per image of 0.8635, making it suitable for the competition. The choice of Binary Crossentropy over combined or Dice loss consistently yielded better results, likely due to its robustness in handling class imbalance in cloud segmentation tasks.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [13]
>>
